From 3b5709e56941c90cf580abbc415aaa2ba2881d00 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: darknagel <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 15:13:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: charge the OnePlus 8 Pro
 battery to full

Add three patches for the PM8150B charger:

- keep at least 500 mA of USB input while VBUS is present, so the phone
  no longer runs from the battery with a charger attached when TCPM
  reports the source offline
- charge by the bq27411 fuel gauge with the limits of the stock
  firmware; the battery stopped at about 88 % before
- name the fuel gauge in the device tree
---
