 ...m_pm8150b-charge-by-the-fuel-gauge-l.patch | 736 ++++++++++++++++++
 ...m8250-oneplus-instantnoodlep-Let-the.patch |  28 +
 .../linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/APKBUILD   |   8 +-
 4 files changed, 873 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
